          "content": "<p>文章] <a href=\"http://blog.pragmaticengineer.com/distributed-architecture-concepts-i-have-learned-while-building-payments-systems/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">分布式系统的几个基本概念</a></p>\n<p>Uber 架构师分享在搭建分布式支付系统过程中，遇到的最重要的几个概念：SLA、scaling、Consistency、Durability、Idempotency等。</p>",
